  "story": {
    "text": "Colonel Brandon tells Elinor the truth about Willoughby. Long ago Brandon loved a girl called Eliza, and her {DAUGHTER}, his young {WARD}, was {BETRAYED} by Willoughby and {DESERTED}. The colonel even fought him in a {DUEL}. Sir John is {INDIGNANT} too: and he had offered the man one of his dog Folly’s {PUPPIES}!",
